            {
                "entry_id": "cff0b550-7d8d-34d1-8aee-3bb6d9c33f06",
                "word": "slacks",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "23ad050a-6147-4af3-9f0a-a6cc546a0169",
                        "entry_id": "cff0b550-7d8d-34d1-8aee-3bb6d9c33f06",
                        "tags": [
                            "attributive"
                        ],
                        "form": "slack"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8510ba4c-f6ba-3280-9207-83509feb147c",
                        "entry_id": "cff0b550-7d8d-34d1-8aee-3bb6d9c33f06",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Semi-formal trousers which are less formal than those that are part of a suit but nowadays are considered suitable casualwear in most offices. (Takes a plural verb even when referring to a single pair; may be referred to as a pair of slacks.)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "dated",
                            "plural",
                            "plural-only"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b77a5d07-b84e-4855-a59b-d266d4b31b07",
                                "sense_id": "8510ba4c-f6ba-3280-9207-83509feb147c",
                                "text": "Discipline, that’s what we need. Discipline. How are we going to win the war without discipline? Do you know, sir, some of these fellows come on parade in slacks - so I’ve been told. Can’t expect to win a war that way. Slacks! My God!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6f757250-53e7-4928-ae43-1146541bcf6b",
                                "sense_id": "8510ba4c-f6ba-3280-9207-83509feb147c",
                                "text": "Not five minutes later, Zooey, with his hair combed wet, stood wet, stood barefoot at the washbowl, wearing a pair of beltless dark-gray sharkskin slacks, a face towel across his bare shoulders."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fcdcf073-a9c8-49eb-a417-cf96c5918dd9",
                                "sense_id": "8510ba4c-f6ba-3280-9207-83509feb147c",
                                "text": "For a change, Selina was not in slacks, but in a simple dirndl and sandals."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f70baf8d-4f70-4a2c-958a-072f518668e8",
                        "source_entry_id": "cff0b550-7d8d-34d1-8aee-3bb6d9c33f06",
                        "source_sense_id": "8510ba4c-f6ba-3280-9207-83509feb147c",
                        "source_sense_description": "Semi-formal trousers not part of a suit",
                        "target_lang_word": "Slacks",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Slacks",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "763b20ad-9919-3e1b-ae8c-4a10ca08cb18",
                                        "entry_id": "a103b6ee-a901-371c-aff4-4c56992f57f8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "lange, legere Damenhose"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eee10d38-9662-4013-971e-5c0d86cda9bd",
                                                "sense_id": "763b20ad-9919-3e1b-ae8c-4a10ca08cb18",
                                                "text": "„Sie trug weiße Slacks, die so eng saßen, daß sie lauter horizontale Falten über den Bauch warfen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9e155d15-fec3-4b2a-b05c-220086f82a3d",
                        "source_entry_id": "cff0b550-7d8d-34d1-8aee-3bb6d9c33f06",
                        "source_sense_id": "8510ba4c-f6ba-3280-9207-83509feb147c",
                        "source_sense_description": "Semi-formal trousers not part of a suit",
                        "target_lang_word": "штаны́",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "штаны́",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2a36898a-2cb1-3c91-a541-3fdc6033d0dc",
                                        "entry_id": "394e7412-0caf-323d-9fbd-24b5e3db9423",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "предмет верхней одежды, покрывающий нижнюю часть тела, в том числе каждую ногу отдельно, и закрывающий колени"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ac625ca-3e8e-4746-a764-2d22a1deb127",
                                                "sense_id": "2a36898a-2cb1-3c91-a541-3fdc6033d0dc",
                                                "text": "Он одет в кумачную рубаху и синие нанковые штаны."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df820430-92d6-458d-ba64-b84732f58ad2",
                                                "sense_id": "2a36898a-2cb1-3c91-a541-3fdc6033d0dc",
                                                "text": "— Зулусы — это которые без штанов ходят, а для продовольствия употребляют знакомых, — говорит важно Белухин."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2fdc456-e3f7-4216-b153-10d2626505cc",
                                                "sense_id": "2a36898a-2cb1-3c91-a541-3fdc6033d0dc",
                                                "text": "Петька чуть не разодрал штаны о какой-то ржавый гвоздь."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bd69ab7c-b1b9-357b-bede-ebf3fdfe1745",
                                        "entry_id": "394e7412-0caf-323d-9fbd-24b5e3db9423",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "прост. предмет нижнего белья; трусы; панталоны"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0935f1ee-514b-44d1-9a26-bfc3fde3d877",
                                                "sense_id": "bd69ab7c-b1b9-357b-bede-ebf3fdfe1745",
                                                "text": "Сонечка безуспешно взывала о горшке, потом от безнадежности надула в штаны."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "штаны́",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e414d1e9-fc8e-3726-b5e5-dbdb0ab4ff94",
                                        "entry_id": "d84494ad-96bd-3c39-952c-2bbc119c4778",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "ж.-д. то же, что противошёрстный взрез стрелки; авария (случай брака в работе), при которой колёсные пары или тележки подвижного состава следуют по разным путям стрелочного перевода; обычно приводит к сходу с рельсов"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
